<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sallie Mae raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sallie Mae raised to buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities upgraded Student Loan Marketing Association (Sallie Mae) to buy from hold, a source at Prudential said.</p>
<p>-- further details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
